<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mr. Sun returns two weeks after his first visit and is seen the same day by Dr. Choi of medical oncology. He had the multiphase CT eleven days ago, the MRI with MRCP a week ago and the ultrasound-guided core biopsy five days ago; the biopsy site was sore for a day. He asked to see the images and went through them with Dr. Huang and Dr. Choi. The ache under his right ribs is 2 of 10 on acetaminophen once or twice a day, and he is eating five small meals a day. He has had no jaundice, itching, dark urine, fever or vomiting. He is still working full days and asked for a plain account of the findings and the choices. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Tests done</td><td>Multiphase CT, MRI with MRCP, core biopsy of the liver mass</td></tr><tr><td>Pain</td><td>2 of 10 on acetaminophen once or twice a day</td></tr><tr><td>Appetite and weight</td><td>Five small meals a day; weight 60.6 kg</td></tr><tr><td>Associated signs and symptoms</td><td>No jaundice, itching, dark urine, fever, or vomiting</td></tr><tr><td>His request</td><td>To see the images and hear the findings and choices plainly</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

