    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Weight down a further 0.4 kg; tired in the evenings; no fever</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Ache under the right ribs, 2 of 10; early fullness; no vomiting, jaundice, or pale stools</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No cough or breathlessness</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No itching; biopsy site healed</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

